South Dakota QSO Party -- the 66 South Dakota counties, each its own multiplier.
Four-letter codes from the sponsor's rules page (docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/SouthDakota/SD-QSO-PARTY-Counties.txt, retrieved 2026-11-18); the same 66 codes as DXLog.net's SDQP.txt.
No county maps to the state: the rules count South Dakota counties as multipliers of their own for every entrant, once.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

